    <item>
      <title>有法拉利沒賽車手！台灣 AI 轉型路上算力充足，但缺軟體與人才</title>
      <link>https://www.inside.com.tw/feature/light-up-taiwan-ai/40622-ai-taiwan-make-over</link>
      <description>台灣砸重金購入數千張 NVIDIA 高階晶片，期待打造 AI 代工王國，卻面臨致命盲點：有法拉利等級算力，卻缺舒馬克級軟體人才。專家警告，若無法取得歐盟 GDPR 認定、通過美國 NIST 標準，台灣恐淪「數位二房東」，只能處理低價值數據、賺取電費價差，錯失 AI 產業最豐厚利潤。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.inside.com.tw/feature/light-up-taiwan-ai/40622-ai-taiwan-make-over</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://bucket-image.inkmaginecms.com/version/hd/1/image/2024/04/9f957717-86fd-41ad-abf5-286cb81393ab.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2026 09:55:00 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>專訪是方電訊副總江文漢：是方如何打造東亞算力轉運站？</title>
      <link>https://www.inside.com.tw/feature/light-up-taiwan-ai/40652-interview-with-chief-telecom-vice-president-chiang-wen-han-how-chief-is-building-an-east-asia-compute-transit-hub</link>
      <description>AI 時代的成功關鍵，除了算力有多強，另一個就在於算力與資料的順暢流動。是方電訊以「電信中立」為核心，打造讓雲端、網路與算力自由交換的平台，結合專為 AI 設計的機房及台灣地緣優勢，目標成為東亞算力轉運樞紐。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.inside.com.tw/feature/light-up-taiwan-ai/40652-interview-with-chief-telecom-vice-president-chiang-wen-han-how-chief-is-building-an-east-asia-compute-transit-hub</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://bucket-image.inkmaginecms.com/version/hd/9dde7c0f-a597-445c-80dd-9a93db8a4006/image/2026/02/3a4452d3-ffeb-4cca-9c55-186b10c9b742.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2026 11:06:00 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
